{title: 672 - Spirit of the Living God}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #672 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 672}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Spirit ofthe living [Am]God,
[F/C]Fall afresh [C7]on me!
[F]Spirit ofthe living [Am]God,
[C7/G]Fall afresh [F]on [Bb]me!
[Bb]Break me, [Gm]melt [Am/C]me, [C7]mold [F]me, [Bb]fill me!
[F]Spirit of the [Dm]living [Gm]God,
[C]Fall afresh [C7]on me!
{end_of_verse}
